One suggestion which might solve some of the user interface problems
is to have the interface separate from nethack.  All of the movement/
attacking/etc. would be handled by nethack, but screen displays, keyboard
commands, etc. would be handled by a different program like nethack_interface.

Thus, there could be several interfaces to nethack, and you could use the
one which you like the best.

